/* 大世界街巷事件库 卷3 / 港区·小巷·海滩·森林日常与NPC偶遇 / 零编号命名 */
:: MP World Mer AnchorBollardBag [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "mer">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Mer Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Mer Street">>
<</if>>
梅尔街海员俱乐部外侧的锚链桩下塞着一只防水帆布袋。<<mpAmbient>>你放缓脚步环顾四周，发现防水帆布袋边缘还留着前人封存时的暗记。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[缓步走回梅尔街边 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="wev-mp-world-mer-anchorbollardbag">
<<investigateicon>><<link "取出帆布袋 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-mer-anchorbollardbag">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_mer_anchorbollardbag")>><<money 220>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	你顺着梅尔街海的掩护打开水帆布袋，将里面的旧银币与未鉴定古物揣进衣袋。<span class="green">你在梅尔街海顺遂起出了水帆布袋。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	水帆布袋卡得颇紧，你伸手拨弄时指节蹭在粗糙的边角上，擦出了一道红印。<span class="red">指节被水帆布袋边角刮痛，只得先缩回手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP World Mer AnchorBollardBag]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回梅尔街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "沿石缝抽出 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-mer-anchorbollardbag">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_mer_anchorbollardbag_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	你顺着边缘探到封蜡口，将防水帆布袋连同夹层里的零钞一并取下。<span class="green">你用巧劲取下了完好无损的防水帆布袋。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[走回梅尔街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	街口忽然传来路人交谈声，你动作一滞，袖口蹭上了一点浮灰。<span class="red">为免引人注意，你先停手退开半步。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压住台面重新着力 (0:04)|MP World Mer AnchorBollardBag]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回外围通道 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Elk PulleyRailPadlock [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Elk Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Elk Street">>
<</if>>
麋鹿街三号仓库的滑轮导轨槽里卡着一只黄铜挂锁与钥匙串。<<mpAmbient>>你驻足留心观察四周动静，发现黄铜挂锁与钥匙串边缘还留着前人封存时的暗记。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回麋鹿街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="wev-mp-world-elk-pulleyrailpadlock">
<<investigateicon>><<link "取出挂锁钥匙 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-elk-pulleyrailpadlock">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_elk_pulleyrailpadlock")>><<money 220>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	你顺着麋鹿街三的掩护打开与钥匙串，把内藏的旧银币与古物妥善收入囊中。<span class="green">你在麋鹿街三顺遂起出了与钥匙串。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收好器物返回 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	与钥匙串卡得颇紧，你伸手拨弄时指节蹭在粗糙的边角上，擦出了一道红印。<span class="red">指节被与钥匙串边角刮痛，只得先缩回手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP World Elk PulleyRailPadlock]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回麋鹿街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "顺墙根暗槽移出 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-elk-pulleyrailpadlock">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_elk_pulleyrailpadlock_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	你拨开簧片卸下锁扣，将黄铜挂锁与钥匙串连同夹层里的零钞一并取下。<span class="green">你完好取下了黄铜挂锁与钥匙串。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[转回麋鹿街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	远处响起马车碾过石板的声响，你手腕微偏没能着力。<span class="red">你收回手指，决定等街面安静些再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺着卯眼重新发力 (0:04)|MP World Elk PulleyRailPadlock]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转回麋鹿街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

